WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Humph! Why? You know it in your heart

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:04,900
There is no enmity between you and me.

3
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:07,100
I really don’t know where I offended you

4
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:11,300
Still pretending? My proudest brown tail was cut off by you in a sneak attack

5
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,900
If you don't go back to your home today, my master will give it up.

6
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:19,100
Misunderstanding! How dare I provoke you? I can’t even do it with my strength.

7
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:22,300
You dare to quibble while I've eaten a piece of grass and turned my hand over the cave?

8
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,700
Take a look for yourself and see what's hanging in the book.

9
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:29,900
If I didn't know how to climb trees, I would kill you all right now.

10
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:34,710
Why does it smell so bad?

11
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:36,730
But it's pretty cool

12
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:57,660
Isn't it true that Jian is alone in advocating evil?

13
00:00:58,060 --> 00:01:00,260
Why do you come in groups?

14
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:01,860
It's okay for you to humiliate us.

15
00:01:02,060 --> 00:01:03,460
And humiliate our entire tribe

16
00:01:03,860 --> 00:01:05,260
Now we are asked why

17
00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:14,760
Tie Yu died in the hands of these Tang Lang

18
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:17,560
There must be some misunderstanding among you guys.

19
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:20,360
There's a misunderstanding. Let's talk about it first except you, the Tanglang Clan.

20
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:23,560
Hatred will only dissipate if it tears you apart

21
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:27,160
Stop talking nonsense and kill these damn wolves together.
